    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_temporal_aggregator" kindref="compound">TemporalAggregator</ref></para>
<para>Computes windowed aggregations over the system-time (sys_start) of rows in a <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_system_versioned_table" kindref="compound">SystemVersionedTable</ref>. Only rows that were current at any point within the query range are included.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: const methods; the caller is responsible for not mutating the table concurrently during an aggregation call. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
